ALL NOT EXCEED THE TOTAL FEES PAID HEREUNDER IN THE TWELVE (12) MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM.\n\n3. GOVERNING LAW AND JURISDICTION\nThis Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware, without regard to conflicts of law principles.\n\n4. CONFIDENTIALITY AND DATA PROTECTION\nEach party agrees to maintain in strict confidence all proprietary information disclosed by the other party.\nSecurity breaches involving Client Data must be reported within twenty-four (24) hours of detection.","ocr_confidence":null,"version_group":"2395e7b0-722d-42ca-8fe6-5f362f520085","version_number":1,"risk_score":33,"created_at":"2026-09-04T09:14:07.756Z","storage_path":"C:\\Users\\DELL\\Downloads\\Docu-Gaurd AI\\Docu-Gaurd AI\\data\\uploads\\2395e7b0-722d-42ca-8fe6-5f362f520085.enc","extraction_status":"COMPLETED","extraction_method":"DIRECT_TEXT","page_count":1,"character_count":1181,"processed_at":"2026-09-04T14:44:11.536Z","analysis_status":"COMPLETED","analysis_error":null,"analysis_error_internal":null,"tenant_id":null},{"id":"bbdf02ac-83ee-4d9e-8d92-03609d684931","user_id":"f9074205-a2e9-453a-859e-0375159b08fc","filename":"Secret_TenantB_Agreement.pdf","original_name":"Secret_TenantB_Agreement.pdf","mime_type":null,"size":null,"sha256":null,"encrypted":true,"extracted_text":"\nVENDOR SERVICES AGREEMENT\nEffective Date: October 01, 2025\nThis Agreement expires on October 01, 2026.\nTerm and Renewal: This Agreement automatically renews for 1 year unless written notice of at least 30 days is given prior to expiration.\nLimitation of Liability: The aggregate liability shall not exceed $250,000 USD.\nGoverning Law: This agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of California.\n","ocr_confidence":null,"version_group":null,"version_number":1,"risk_score":50,"created_at":"2026-09-04T12:44:09.143Z","storage_path":null,"extraction_status":"COMPLETED","extraction_method":null,"page_count":1,"character_count":0,"processed_at":"2026-09-0