ain industrial robotics hardware.\n\nSection 2. Maintenance and Inspection\nLessee shall maintain the hardware in good working condition and allow quarterly inspections.\n","ocr_confidence":1,"version_group":"c19bbc10-50e2-4dfa-9547-c205f0287b27","version_number":1,"risk_score":35,"created_at":"2026-09-02T08:13:33.650Z","storage_path":null,"extraction_status":"COMPLETED","extraction_method":null,"page_count":1,"character_count":0,"processed_at":"2026-09-02T13:43:41.663Z","analysis_status":"COMPLETED","analysis_error":null,"analysis_error_internal":null,"tenant_id":null},{"id":"8260eb7f-cbf9-4031-9b1c-423e54224e04","user_id":"f9074205-a2e9-453a-859e-0375159b08fc","filename":"8260eb7f-cbf9-4031-9b1c-423e54224e04.enc","original_name":"master_agreement.txt","mime_type":"text/plain","size":426,"sha256":"775ce3652a751302c1d09dcd4dee680e86b5962c9a150e38082caaa27212b794","encrypted":true,"extracted_text":"MASTER SERVICES AGREEMENT\n\nSection 1. Confidentiality\nEach party agrees to maintain the confidentiality of all proprietary information disclosed hereunder.\n\nSection 2. Termination\nEither party may terminate this Agreement early by providing thirty (30) days prior written notice to the other party.\n\nSection 3. Governing Law\nThis Agreement shall be governed and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Delaware.","ocr_confidence":null,"version_group":"8260eb7f-cbf9-4031-9b1c-423e54224e04","version_number":1,"risk_score":35,"created_at":"2026-09-01T10:44:28.676Z","storage_path":"C:\\Users\\DELL\\Downloads\\Docu-Gaurd AI\\Docu-Gaurd AI\\data\\uploads\\8260eb7f-cbf9-4031-9b1c-423e54224e04.enc","extraction_status":"COMPLETED","extraction_method":"DIRECT_TEXT","page_count":1,"character_count":425,"processed_at":"2026-09-01T16:14:33.585Z","analysis_status":"COMPLETED","analysis_error":null,"analysis_error_internal":null,"tenant_id":null},{"id":"9b10ffdc-ddb3-4a40-ad2c-47190add8417","user_id":"f9074205-a2e9-453a-859e-0375159b08fc","filename":"9b10ffdc-ddb3-4a40